<title>USA: Suburban Propane in deal with Duke.</title>
<headline>Suburban Propane in deal with Duke.</headline>
<dateline>WHIPPANY, N.J. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suburban Propane Partners LP said Tuesday it had finalized a marketing agreement with Duke Energy Trading and Marketing to sell propane and natural gas.</p>
<p>The company said that through the comission-based agreement, Duke will sell propane on behalf of Suburban, and Suburban wil market Duke's natural gas to its current and prospective customers.</p>
<p>Duke Energy Trading and Marketing is a unit of Duke Energy Corp.</p>
</text>
